---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="sn-p.sh" description="Placeholder.">
  <p class="statement">Hi :)</p>

  <div class="body">
    This site is, for the most part, my space to shout thoughts into the void.
    Writing helps me think through things and is meditative for me, especially
    in these sloppy times we've found ourselves in. It should go without saying,
    but all of the writing here is my own.
  </div>
  <div style="height: 1rem;"></div>
  <div class="body">
    The site's name is a play on a "snapshot," whether of my life, my views at
    the time, places I've been, or similar.
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .statement {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    max-width: 22ch;
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .body {
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .body p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
</style>
